  "label": "User projected onto the visual group as an incomplete entity",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the group of Black men in traditional warrior attire. The text 'prospective without white \"\"' implies that the group is 'incomplete' or 'lacking' without white people, thereby projecting a dehumanizing racial hierarchy onto the visual material. The user, by consuming and interpreting the meme, is implicitly positioned as someone who might endorse or be influenced by this racist framing, even if not explicitly stated. The projection is onto the visual group, which is analogically mapped as the 'prospective' entity that is 'without white', reinforcing an anti-Black stereotype rooted in white supremacist ideology.",
